# Fill-up Tracking CSV
# Format: date,mpg,notes
# Lines starting with # are comments and will be ignored
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to fillups.csv
# 2. Add your fill-up data (one line per fill-up)
# 3. Date format: YYYY-MM-DD
# 4. MPG: Your calculated fuel economy (miles driven / gallons purchased)
# 5. Notes: Optional description (can be blank but comma still required)
#
# Example entries:

date,mpg,notes
2026-02-15,28.5,Shell station on Main St
2026-02-22,27.8,
2026-03-01,29.2,Premium fuel test
